<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="templates/style.css" />
<!--
<style>
 {{>templates/style.css}}
</style>
-->
<title>Clinical Genome Report: id-{{id}}</title>
</head>

<body>

    <section class="report">
        <h1 class="technical">TECHNICAL GENOME REPORT</h1>
        <div class="info-grid">
            <div class="list bordered flex">
                {{#header}}
                    <item class="flex-item-50pc">
                        <label>{{ label }}</label>
                        <value>{{ value }}</value>
                    </item>
                {{/header}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="summary-box technical list">
            <item>
                <label>Summary</label>
                <value>
                    {{#summary}}
                        <span style="font-style: {{font}};">{{text}}</span>
                    {{/summary}}
                </value>
            </item>
        </div>

        <div class="summary-box organism list">
		    <item>
                <label>Organism</label>
                <value>
                    <em>{{organism.species}}</em>. <em>Species match: {{organism.species_match}}</em>
                </value>
            </item>
        </div>

        <div class="content amr">
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label>Antibiotic resistance determinants</label>
                    <value class="description">
                        Resistance determinants identified through {{kleborate.vc}}. Only determinants with &gt;90% coverage
                        and &gt;90% identity shown, also those with imprecise protein matches or reduced coverage will be
                        flagged. Genetic variants (homologs) are highlighted *. "None found" means no resistance mechanisms
                        have been identified in the antimicrobial resistance databases that exist at the time of reporting,
                        correlate with phenotype. &dagger; Macrolides and tetracycline lack breakpoints as not recommended
                        for therapy, resistance determinants included here. It is best practice to review these with the
                        phenotypic antibiotic susceptibility profile.
                        <a href="https://github.com/klebgenomics/Kleborate" target="_blank">
		                    <span style="white-space:nowrap">https://github.com/klebgenomics/Kleborate</span>
                        </a>.
                    </value>
                </item>
            </div>

            <div class="scrollable">
                <table class="amr">
                    <tr>
                        <th>Drug class</th>
                        <th>Acquired genotypes</th>
                    </tr>
                    {{#antibiotic_resistance_determinants}}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{{drug_class}}}</td>
                            <td>{{acquired_genotypes}}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{/antibiotic_resistance_determinants}}
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content typing">
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label>Bacterial typing</label>
                    <value class="description">{{bacterial_typing.description}}</value>
                </item>
            </div>
            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="st">
                    {{bacterial_typing.typing}}<br />
                    Sequence type (ST): {{bacterial_typing.sequence_type}}
                </div>
                <div class="profile">
                    <table>
                        <tr>
                            <td rowspan="2" class="profile_heading">Profile:</td>
                            {{#bacterial_typing.profile}}
                                <th>{{gene}}</th>
                            {{/bacterial_typing.profile}}
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            {{#bacterial_typing.profile}}
                                <td>{{allele}}</td>
                            {{/bacterial_typing.profile}}
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="list">
                    <item>
                        <label class="discrete">Phylogroup</label>
                        <value>{{bacterial_typing.phylogroup}}</value>
                    </item>
                </div>
                <div class="list">
                    <item>
                        <label class="discrete">Sublineage</label>
                        <value>{{bacterial_typing.sublineage}}</value>
                    </item>
                </div>
                <div class="list">
                    <item>
                        <label class="discrete">Clonal group</label>
                        <value>{{bacterial_typing.clonal_group}}</value>
                    </item>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label class="discrete">LIN (Life Identification Number)</label>
                    <value>{{bacterial_typing.lin}}</value>
                </item>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content capsule">
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label>Capsule and O typing</label>
                    <value class="description">
                        {{capsule_typing.description}}
                        <a href="{{capsule_typing.url}}" target="_blank">
                            <span style="white-space: nowrap">
                                {{capsule_typing.url}}
                            </span>
                        </a>.
                    </value>
                </item>
            </div>
            <div class="info-grid">
                {{#capsule_typing.results}}
                    <div class="list">
                        <item>
                            <label class="discrete">
                                <em>{{type}}</em>
                            </label>
                            <value>
                                <em>{{value}}</em>
                            </value>
                        </item>
                    </div>
                {{/capsule_typing.results}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content virulence">
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label>Hypervirulence factors</label>
                    <value>
                        {{virulence_determinants.description}}
                        <a href="{{virulence_determinants.url}}" target="_blank">
                            <span style="white-space:nowrap">
                                {{virulence_determinants.url}}
                            </span>
                        </a>.
                    </value>
                </item>
                <div class="list">
                    <item>
                        <label class="discrete">Virulence score</label>
                        <value>
                            {{virulence_determinants.virulence_score}}
                        </value>
                    </item>
                </div>
                <div class="info-grid">
                    <div class="list">
                        <item><label>Acquired siderophores</label></item>
                        {{#virulence_determinants.acquired_siderophores}}
                            <item>
                                <label class="discrete">{{type}}</label>
                                <value>{{value}}</value>
                            </item>
                        {{/virulence_determinants.acquired_siderophores}}
                    </div>
                    <div class="list">
                        <item><label>Other factors</label></item>
                        {{#virulence_determinants.other_factors}}
                            <item>
                                <label class="discrete">{{type}}</label>
                                <value>{{value}}</value>
                            </item>
                        {{/virulence_determinants.other_factors}}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content plasmid">
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label>Plasmid Inc typing</label>
                    <value class="description">
                        {{plasmid.description}}
                        <a href="{{plasmid.url}}" target="_blank">
                            <span style="white-space: nowrap">
                                {{plasmid.url}}
                            </span>
                        </a>
                    </value>
                </item>
                <item>
                    <label class="discrete">Plasmid type</label>
                    <value>
                        {{#plasmid.type}}
                            <span>{{value}} ({{locus_identity}} locus identity). </span>
                        {{/plasmid.type}}
                    </value>
                </item>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content outbreak">
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label>Outbreak analysis</label>
                    <value class="description">
                        {{outbreak.description}}
                        <a href="{{outbreak.url}}" target="_blank">
                            <span style="white-space: nowrap">
                                {{outbreak.url}}
                            </span>
                        </a>.
                    </value>
                </item>
            </div>
            <p class="heading">Allele based:</p>
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label class="discrete">LIN (Life Identification Number)</label>
                    <value>{{outbreak.lin}}</value>
                </item>
                <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">(based on cgMLST scheme with 629 genes)</p>
            </div>
            <table class="zebra">
                <tr>
                    <th>id</th>
                    <th>isolate</th>
                    <th>country</th>
                    <th>year</th>
                    <th>LINcode</th>
                </tr>
                {{#outbreak.isolates}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{id}}</td>
                        <td>{{isolate}}</td>
                        <td>{{country}}</td>
                        <td>{{year}}</td>
                        <td>{{lincode}}</td>
                    </tr>
                {{/outbreak.isolates}}
            </table>
            <p class="note">
                Most isolates with identical LIN codes (all 10 thresholds) have &lt;100 and often &lt;5
                single nucleotide differences, but further single nucleotide analysis may be required for
                these isolates in cluster/outbreak investigations.
            </p>
        </div>        

        <div class="content qc">
            <div class="list">
                <item>
                    <label>QC status</label>
                    <value class="description">based on {{quality_control.criteria_by_institution}} criteria.</value>
                </item>
                <item>
                    <label>Genome quality</label>
                    <value>{{quality_control.genome_quality}}</value>
                </item>

                <table class="qc">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Species match:</td>
                        <td>{{quality_control.species_match}} <span class="note">[determined with Kleborate]</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Genome size:</td>
                        <td>{{quality_control.genome_size}} bp <span class="note">[accepted criteria 4,969,898; 6,132,846]</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Contigs:</td>
                        <td>{{quality_control.contigs}} <span class="note">[accepted criteria <500]</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>%GC content:</td>
                        <td>{{quality_control.gc_content}} <span class="note">[accepted criteria 56.35-57.98]</span></td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
        
    </section>
</body>
